name: Séance — straight-flush spectral
author: corpus
description: >-
  If the played poker hand is a Straight Flush, Séance creates a random Spectral card.
  First-shop spectral engine: Four Fingers + Smeared Joker make 4-card Straight Flushes
  possible; Seltzer retriggers the scoring.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Seance
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: FourFingers
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 45
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 25
